WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.500
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.875
told Arjuna

4
00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.416
that He creates, sustains,

5
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:38.125
and dissolves all creation –

6
00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:40.958
yet remains detached from it.

7
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.250
In this verse, He explains

8
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.750
how He stays unattached

9
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.416
from the pull of this creation.

10
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:54.333
This material nature

11
00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:57.750
works under the direction of Lord Krishna.

12
00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.291
Every living and non-living thing

13
00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:02.875
moves under His supervision.

14
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:05.666
And this is what Lord Krishna

15
00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:08.250
wants us to understand through this verse.

16
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.958
Let us understand it with an example.

17
00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:14.791
In a king’s palace,

18
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:16.333
countless ministers, servants,

19
00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:18.583
and officials work.

20
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:20.458
Every policy of the kingdom runs

21
00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:23.125
by the king’s command,

22
00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:23.833
yet

23
00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:27.083
he himself is not engaged in the
 day-to-day tasks.

24
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:29.958
In the same way,
the entire universe functions

25
00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:32.750
under the shelter of Lord Krishna.

26
00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:35.458
He is the controller of all creation –

27
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:39.083
yet He always remains detached from it.

28
00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:43.041
In this verse, the word ‘mayadhyakshena’
carries special significance –

29
00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:45.541
meaning ‘under My supervision.’

30
00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:46.625
Lord Krishna witnesses

31
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:48.083
every activity

32
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:49.708
of this world

33
00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.208
without becoming involved in it.

34
00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:52.916
Nature carries out its functions

35
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:55.125
according to His command –

36
00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:58.708
creation, sustenance, and dissolution.

37
00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:00.875
But just as a judge in a court

38
00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:02.916
only delivers a verdict

39
00:02:02.916 --> 00:02:05.750
without becoming emotionally involved –

40
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.458
Lord Krishna too

41
00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:11.666
watches this creation only as a witness,

42
00:02:11.666 --> 00:02:13.583
remaining detached.

43
00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:18.458
When the world seems
 chaotic and disorderly to us,

44
00:02:18.458 --> 00:02:20.125
when it feels like everything in life

45
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:23.875
is going against our plans –

46
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:26.250
this verse assures us

47
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:29.291
that under Lord Krishna’s watch,

48
00:02:29.291 --> 00:02:32.666
everything is happening in perfect order.

49
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:34.375
There is a purpose

50
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:36.500
behind all that occurs.

51
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.291
Even as the sustainer of all creation,

52
00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.000
He gives us the freedom

53
00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.916
to follow our own desires.

54
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:45.916
But alongside that freedom,

55
00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:48.083
He watches over us with a compassionate eye –

56
00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:49.750
like parents

57
00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.083
watching a child

58
00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:54.000
absorbed in play.

59
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.875
Lord Krishna knows
that one day this soul,

60
00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:59.083
tired and lost,

61
00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:00.375
will return.

62
00:03:00.375 --> 00:03:02.791
And He waits patiently

63
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:06.500
for us to turn back toward Him.

64
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.458
This is His greatness and His detachment.

65
00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:12.208
This verse teaches us that even amid

66
00:03:12.208 --> 00:03:13.791
the turbulence of life,

67
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:17.458
if we place our trust in Lord Krishna

68
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.583
and follow His teachings,
this journey can become

69
00:03:20.583 --> 00:03:24.750
the means of our spiritual growth.

70
00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:31.916
Do you want everything in life

71
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:35.458
to be under your control?

72
00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:38.708
Most people do –

73
00:03:38.708 --> 00:03:40.791
and that very effort

74
00:03:40.791 --> 00:03:44.333
becomes the cause of their suffering.

75
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:45.791
When situations unfold

76
00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:49.375
contrary to your hopes,

77
00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:51.583
the mind begins to sink

78
00:03:51.583 --> 00:03:55.708
into worry and disappointment.

79
00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:57.750
But

80
00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:02.458
not everything can run
 according to your control –

81
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:06.083
and this is the law of creation.

82
00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:08.333
I know there may be times

83
00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:11.166
when it feels like nothing

84
00:04:11.166 --> 00:04:12.458
is going

85
00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:16.250
according to your plan.

86
00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:20.375
Everything seems out of control.

87
00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:22.958
Do not be disheartened.

88
00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:27.291
And always keep this in mind –

89
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:31.041
I am the controller of all.

90
00:04:31.041 --> 00:04:33.916
There is a purpose behind everything

91
00:04:33.916 --> 00:04:38.125
that is happening.

92
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:42.000
Nothing occurs by chance.

93
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:46.875
The day you accept this truth,

94
00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:50.916
even in your darkest moments,

95
00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:54.791
you will find a ray of hope.

96
00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:56.416
Suppose

97
00:04:56.416 --> 00:05:00.083
you fail at something.

98
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:02.333
Your mind fills with disappointment

99
00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:05.541
and distress.

100
00:05:05.541 --> 00:05:07.291
But

101
00:05:07.291 --> 00:05:08.958
what you call

102
00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:11.250
failure

103
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.458
is actually

104
00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:16.625
a signal from Me –

105
00:05:16.625 --> 00:05:21.208
to turn you in a new direction,

106
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:25.000
to deepen your thinking,

107
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.875
to make you stronger.

108
00:05:27.875 --> 00:05:30.750
Whatever is happening

109
00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.791
is happening for your good –

110
00:05:34.791 --> 00:05:36.666
even if it feels

111
00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:39.625
like failure right now.

112
00:05:39.625 --> 00:05:42.208
When your plans fall apart,

113
00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:44.791
it does not mean

114
00:05:44.791 --> 00:05:48.000
I have abandoned you.

115
00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.041
It is a sign that the time has come

116
00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:53.833
to trust Me more deeply

117
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:57.083
and move forward on the spiritual path

118
00:05:57.083 --> 00:06:00.625
with complete faith.

119
00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:03.041
But remember –

120
00:06:03.041 --> 00:06:07.083
faith does not mean

121
00:06:07.083 --> 00:06:10.583
every situation will happen as you wish.

122
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:12.916
Faith means

123
00:06:12.916 --> 00:06:17.625
staying active in every situation,

124
00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:19.708
knowing that

125
00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:24.375
I am always working for your wellbeing –

126
00:06:24.375 --> 00:06:29.333
watching everything that’s happening,

127
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:32.750
and clearing the path ahead.

128
00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:37.458
So whenever your plans fail,

129
00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:39.416
do not lose heart.

130
00:06:39.416 --> 00:06:42.375
Remember – I am the one who governs

131
00:06:42.375 --> 00:06:45.083
this creation.

132
00:06:45.083 --> 00:06:50.375
My plan is far greater than yours.

133
00:06:50.375 --> 00:06:53.833
Trust Me –

134
00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:56.541
whatever is happening

135
00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:59.458
is for your good.

136
00:07:04.291 --> 00:07:07.500
As an elder in the family,

137
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:11.958
your role is much like Mine.

138
00:07:11.958 --> 00:07:16.250
Just as I watch over all of creation

139
00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.083
as its master –

140
00:07:18.083 --> 00:07:21.500
maintaining balance,

141
00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.666
yet giving nature

142
00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:28.791
freedom within its bounds –

143
00:07:28.791 --> 00:07:34.208
in the same way,
be a guide and a watchful presence

144
00:07:34.208 --> 00:07:38.125
within your family.

145
00:07:38.125 --> 00:07:40.916
Tell your family members
what is good

146
00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:45.250
and what is harmful for them.

147
00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:48.375
But while guiding and watching over them,

148
00:07:48.375 --> 00:07:53.333
do not interfere too deeply in their lives.

149
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:55.166
If you try to control

150
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:57.250
every small and large matter,

151
00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:01.583
and interfere in their freedom,

152
00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:06.250
family members will lose
their independence.

153
00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.291
But this does not mean

154
00:08:08.291 --> 00:08:12.583
you become completely indifferent.

155
00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:16.583
Always offer guidance

156
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:18.875
so they do not lose direction –

157
00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:21.375
and can understand right from wrong

158
00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:22.541
and can understand right from wrong

159
00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:25.458
and grow in their own lives.

160
00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:27.291
Think of

161
00:08:27.291 --> 00:08:31.250
your family as a garden.

162
00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.916
You plant the seeds,

163
00:08:33.916 --> 00:08:35.666
water them,

164
00:08:35.666 --> 00:08:39.250
and care for them.

165
00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:43.208
But you cannot force a flower to bloom.

166
00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:47.791
The flower must be allowed
 to bloom in its own time.

167
00:08:47.791 --> 00:08:51.875
Simply give it love and space –

168
00:08:51.875 --> 00:08:55.500
and this balance of love and freedom

169
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:59.250
is just as essential for a family.

170
00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.916
This is the foundation

171
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:05.125
of a healthy and balanced home.

172
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:11.208
Guide – but with freedom.

173
00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:15.333
Love – but with discipline.

174
00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:17.625
This is the balance.

175
00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:20.291
And in balance lies true happiness.

176
00:09:25.083 --> 00:09:29.375
The workplace is a ground where success

177
00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:32.708
and failure come and go.

178
00:09:32.708 --> 00:09:35.458
But when success comes,

179
00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:39.291
do you start to feel invincible?

180
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:41.500
And when failure comes,

181
00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.250
do you begin to question

182
00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.083
your own abilities?

183
00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:47.500
Do you know why this happens?

184
00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.708
It happens because you feel

185
00:09:49.708 --> 00:09:52.250
that everything is happening

186
00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:55.750
under your control alone.

187
00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:56.958
But

188
00:09:56.958 --> 00:10:01.541
I want to tell you something.

189
00:10:01.541 --> 00:10:05.875
This world operates under My control.

190
00:10:05.875 --> 00:10:09.083
Whatever is happening here

191
00:10:09.083 --> 00:10:11.666
is happening by My command.

192
00:10:11.666 --> 00:10:14.708
And when you accept this truth,

193
00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:16.708
the very meaning of success

194
00:10:16.708 --> 00:10:19.208
and failure will change for you.

195
00:10:19.208 --> 00:10:20.750
Remember –

196
00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:25.125
success is not just the result of your effort.

197
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:28.833
It has come to you through the
 right timing, the right opportunity,

198
00:10:28.833 --> 00:10:32.541
and the right guidance.

199
00:10:32.541 --> 00:10:36.625
When you understand this,

200
00:10:36.625 --> 00:10:40.375
you let go of ego and become humble.

201
00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:43.708
And as for failure?

202
00:10:43.708 --> 00:10:47.541
Failure is a pause – 

203
00:10:47.541 --> 00:10:50.333
not a full stop.

204
00:10:50.333 --> 00:10:52.333
It is only temporary,

205
00:10:52.333 --> 00:10:57.208
and it has come to teach you something.

206
00:10:57.208 --> 00:11:00.916
When you accept this truth,

207
00:11:00.916 --> 00:11:05.333
failure will no longer seem negative.

208
00:11:05.333 --> 00:11:09.541
So – let go of attachment to outcomes

209
00:11:09.541 --> 00:11:12.000
and simply act,

210
00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.333
with complete dedication.

211
00:11:14.333 --> 00:11:17.958
And trust in Me,

212
00:11:17.958 --> 00:11:20.916
with complete faith.
